ish, most commonly tuna, salmon, white fish, yellowtail, snapper, and eel. Rainbow roll is quite similar to the California roll, with the addition of tuna, salmon and avocado. Other variants include slices of mango next to avocado, or uses of imitation crab meat, fried shrimp tempura, and other seafood."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-rainbow-roll"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rainbow_roll"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Japanese cuisine","cuisine/japanese-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":4,"links":[["Avocado","ingredient/avocado"],["Crab stick","ingredient/crab-stick"],["Cucumber","ingredient/cucumber"],["Rice","ingredient/rice"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Just One Cookbook","ref":"site/justonecookbook-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"justonecookbook.com","note":"Namiko Chen's long-running blog and videos on Japanese home cooking.","url":"https://justonecookbook.com","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"RecipeTin Japan","ref":"site/japan-recipetineats-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"japan.recipetineats.com","note":"Japanese home recipes from Yumiko, a Japan-born cook, sister site to RecipeTin Eats.","url":"https://japan.recipetineats.com/","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Japanese cuisine","links":[["Bergh–Stoutenburgh House","dish/bergh-stoutenburgh-house"],["Chikuwa","dish/chikuwa"],["Curry bread","dish/curry-bread"],["Donburi","dish/donburi"],["Fukamushicha","dish/fukamushicha"],["Gyokuro","dish/gyokuro"],["Hitsumabushi","dish/hitsumabushi"],["Horumonyaki","dish/horumonyaki"],["Iekei ramen","dish/iekei-ramen"],["Inago no tsukudani","dish/inago-no-tsukudani"],["Itamae","dish/itamae"],["Izakaya","dish/izakaya"],["Japanese cheesecake","dish/japanese-cheesecake"],["Japanese noodles","dish/japanese-noodles"],["Japanese restaurant","dish/japanese-restaurant"],["Japanese tea","dish/japanese-tea"],["Jingisukan","dish/jingisukan"],["Kaki furai"