.org/wiki/Stuffed_leaves"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Cretan cuisine","cuisine/cretan-cuisine"],["Crimean Tatar cuisine","cuisine/crimean-tatar-cuisine"],["Serbian cuisine","cuisine/serbian-cuisine"],["Turkish cuisine","cuisine/turkish-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":5,"links":[["Cabbage","ingredient/cabbage"],["Chili pepper","ingredient/chili-pepper"],["Grape leaves","ingredient/grape-leaves"],["Ground meat","ingredient/ground-meat"],["Rice","ingredient/rice"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Explore Crete: Cretan cooking recipes","ref":"site/explorecrete-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"explorecrete.com","note":"Traditional Cretan recipes drawn from the work of Cretan food writer Nikos Psilakis.","url":"https://www.explorecrete.com/cuisine/psilakis-recipes.html","suggested":true,"kind":"site"},{"name":"Balkan Lunchbox: Kosovo recipes","ref":"site/balkanlunchbox-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"balkanlunchbox.com","note":"Balkan home cooking blog with a section of Serbian dishes.","url":"https://balkanlunchbox.com/category/country/serbian-recipes/page/3","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"Ozlem's Turkish Table","ref":"site/ozlemsturkishtable-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"ozlemsturkishtable.com","note":"Turkish-born cook and teacher Ozlem Warren's blog of home-style Turkish recipes.","url":"https://ozlemsturkishtable.com/tag/turkish-recipes/page/9","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/9/9f/Japrak_1.jpg/500px-Japrak_1.jpg","w":500,"h":329,"by":"Tizilohja25","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Japrak_1.jpg"}},"dish/zrazy":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/zrazy","n":"Zrazy","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish found in 5 cuisines","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Zrazy or zrazi is a meat roulade dish popular in Poland (Silesian rouladen), western Belarus and Lithuania. 